sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RP as Relying Party
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as Authenticator
    RP->>B: Challenge
    Note over B: Records current page Origin
    B->>A: Challenge + Origin
    Note over A: Signs with private key
    A->>B: Assertion Signature
    B->>RP: Assertion
    Note over RP: Verifies signature AND origin match
